  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq Household Socioeconomic Survey III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO of this grant is to support the Government of Iraq to collect quality data to produce poverty estimates and other key demographic and socioeconomic indicators to inform evidence-based policymaking. The project will aid the Central Statistical Organization(CSO) and Kurdistan Region Statistics Office (KRSO) in preparation and implementation of the third round of the Iraq Household Socioeconomic Survey (IHSES III).</narrative>
  </description>
